    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.05,
      398.41,
      547.34,
      529.48
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitutude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Malimbada Divisional Secretariat on this 27th day ofDecember 2018 at 10.30 a.m. and are hereby requested tonotify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 20th dayof December the nature of their interest in the land, theparticulars of their claims for the compensation for theacquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount ofcompensation and the details of the computation of suchamount.",
